 hold only 3 Weapons, swap weapons you find to curate yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T01:18:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939705","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4278840-1840310314350255","game_id":"steam-4278840","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 8/9/26","summary":"Changed HUD color from yellow to white (Additionally, icon locations and number sizes has been changed)A major change to game introduction has been made to the player control tutorialchanges to C.O.C.K headquartersMinor enemy behavior changesMeat shield mechanic added (kick enemies for a chance to stun, once stunned enemies can be grabbed and used as meat shields!)A Collection of cheats added (cheats are activated by typing them on your keyboard while in game) I wont be revealing the cheat names","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T03:03:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314350255","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4278840":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:09:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:09:06Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4278840":"2026-10-26T02:09:06Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4278840":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:09:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:09:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4505560":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:09:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:09:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4278840","app_id":4278840,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:31Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISt